{"page":490,"verses":[{"verse_key":"43:11","surah":43,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِى نَزَّلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءًۢ بِقَدَرٍ فَأَنشَرْنَا بِهِۦ بَلْدَةً مَّيْتًا ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ تُخْرَجُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"who sends water down from the sky in due measure––We resurrect dead land with it, and likewise you will be resurrected from the grave––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"And the One Who","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَزَّلَ","en_gloss":"sends down","transliteration":"nazzala","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَآءًۢ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِقَدَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"in (due) measure","transliteration":"biqadarin","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَأَنشَرْنَا","en_gloss":"then We revive","transliteration":"fa-ansharnā","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَلْدَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a land","transliteration":"baldatan","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّيْتًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"dead","transliteration":"maytan","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تُخْرَجُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be brought forth","transliteration":"tukh'rajūna","verse_key":"43:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١١","en_gloss":"(11)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:11"}]},{"verse_key":"43:12","surah":43,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلْأَزْوَٰجَ كُلَّهَا وَجَعَلَ لَكُم مِّنَ ٱلْفُلْكِ وَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ مَا تَرْكَبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"who created every kind of thing, who gave you ships and animals to ride on","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"And the One Who","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","v